    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: ContractItemPrice records where Price is null or zero or negative.
Why it matters: Zero/negative contracted prices generate no revenue — products billed against this contract come out at $0 on the invoice. Direct revenue stop on contractual items.
Suppress a finding: when the $0 is intentional (free during onboarding, contractually-included).
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
